if we understand what that means being placed into per surplus our preference is that the original pump house structure not be put into surplus but that the kind of current trajectory to try to revitalize it and harness it for the West Edge development is what continues to happen um however if the building is to be put into surplus we recommend that the city put conditions on the sale and also conditioned in the deed requiring that the structure and we have three recommendations number one that the structure not be demolished number two that the exterior of the structure is not altered to the point that it's rendered ineligible for listing on the National Register for Historic Places and

